---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components and data
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product bundles no third-party source code, but the pipeline operates on
data and depends on libraries that carry their own terms:

  * Amap (Gaode) Open Platform POI service
    POI records were retrieved through the Amap Web Service API and remain
    subject to the Amap Open Platform Terms of Service. They are not
    relicensed by the Apache License 2.0 covering this code.

  * OpenStreetMap contributors
    Road network data (road centerlines, junctions, road classes) are
    © OpenStreetMap contributors and available under the Open Database
    License (ODbL) 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

  * Administrative boundary data
    District-level boundaries used for spatial stratification follow the
    terms of their originating provider.

Third-party Python libraries (pandas, GeoPandas, Shapely, SciPy, SQLAlchemy,
NetworkX, neatnet, matplotlib, seaborn, jieba, and others) are installed as
dependencies and are not redistributed here; each remains under its own
license. See requirements.txt for the full dependency list.

